1
00:00:00,600 --> 00:00:04,000
What is the shape of intelligence?

2
00:00:04,400 --> 00:00:09,000
First, we shaped sand.

3
00:00:09,533 --> 00:00:13,667
Purified into silicon. Etched with light.

4
00:00:14,133 --> 00:00:17,400
Electricity activated the machine.

5
00:00:17,933 --> 00:00:21,333
But intelligence was already alive.

6
00:00:21,667 --> 00:00:25,133
In brains. In every cell.

7
00:00:25,667 --> 00:00:29,067
A swarm thinks in motion.

8
00:00:29,467 --> 00:00:33,000
It speaks in chemicals.

9
00:00:33,467 --> 00:00:37,600
We translate that language into signal.

10
00:00:38,333 --> 00:00:42,400
Then build new interfaces with it.

11
00:00:43,400 --> 00:00:47,967
New senses bring a different machine into view.
